 | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ha=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4\\cdot 7+2\\cdot 3 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ha=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 6\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ -3\\cdot 7+6\\cdot 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$Ha=\\begin{bmatrix}34 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292871 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100868 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8451e22a-247e-51dd-8fb1-9ce9b212dc65" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Matrix With Variable Entries by a Column Vector" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050825 :topic/title "Multiplying a Matrix by a Column Vector"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7d780142-c32c-5731-9c87-b112a2684c32" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{a}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291163}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7d780142-c32c-5731-9c87-b112a2684c32" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{a}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291163} :answer-field/id #uuid "2f22dfaf-79ce-5a75-97f7-1195dabf5e31" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291893} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fa1b47f2-6c14-5303-b696-bc367dd4a0ff" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291687}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fa