difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "9be6a24d-da3e-5102-a86d-6e3e4c28e17d" :question/math-academy-id "q-318591" :question/problem "If \n$P=\\begin{bmatrix}m & n & -m \\\\ m & -n & -m \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$u=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ p \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},$\nfind $Pu.$\n\n|  |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $Pu=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-2}} |  |\n|  |  | {{field-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Pu & =\\begin{bmatrix}m & n & -m \\\\ m & -n & -m \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ p \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}m\\cdot 1 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,n\\cdot p & + & (-m)\\cdot 1 \\\\ m\\cdot 1 & + & (-n)\\cdot p & + & (-m)\\cdot 1 \\\\ 0\\cdot 1 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\cdot p & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\cdot 1\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}m & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,np & + & (-m) \\\\ m & + & (-np) & + & (-m) \\\\ 0 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2p & + & 0\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}np \\\\ -np \\\\ 2p\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299692 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100868 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "8451e22a-247e-51dd-8fb1-9ce9b212dc65" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Matrix With Variable Entries by a Column Vector" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050825 :topic/title "Multiplying a Matrix by a Column Vector"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2e24b795-36ec-513b-ba4f-9b7bb0d8954e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5{p}^{2}+2{q}^{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297747}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2e24b795-36ec-513b-ba4f-9b7bb0d8954e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :