 |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 5 & -3 & 7 \\\\ 1 & 8 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\begin{aligned}-4\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6\\cdot (-1) & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2\\cdot 4 \\\\ 5\\cdot 3 & + & (-3)\\cdot (-1) & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,7\\cdot 4 \\\\ 1\\cdot 3 & + & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,8\\cdot (-1) & + & (-2)\\cdot 4\\end{aligned}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-12 & + & (-6) & + & 8 \\\\ 15 & + & 3 & + & 28 \\\\ 3 & + & (-8) & + & (-8)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-10 \\\\ 46 \\\\ -13\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299698 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100866 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff414112-3be2-5b9c-9ded-5025ea05c2b4" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a 2x2 Matrix by a Column Vector" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050825 :topic/title "Multiplying a Matrix by a Column Vector"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d6511398-87a7-5a97-9019-de163bcd8589" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298471}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d6511398-87a7-5a97-9019-de163bcd8589" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298471} :answer-field/id #uuid "4ce02690-633e-5560-854e-b877f4b6e53a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298894} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00ceebbc-8a68-5fa8-98d9-171cf8eb58b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297552}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "00ceebbc-8a68-5fa8-98d9-171cf8eb58b5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297552} :answer-field/id #uuid "b74a3435-80b0-56da-9d2d-54a2017fc702" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299255}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f86a8d09-8955-5065-97fa-d72868178f2c" :question/math-academy-id "q-318640" :question/problem "Compute the following:\n\n| $\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\,\\,$ |  | {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product. Multiplying the first row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}0\\cdot 5+11\\cdot (-1) \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ ∗\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the second row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot 5+2\\cdot (-1)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ -17\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299699 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100866 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ff414112-3be2-5b9c-9ded-5025ea05c2b4" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a 2x2 Matrix by a Column Vector" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050825 :topic/title "Multiplying a Matrix by a Column Vector"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8702