row, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-34 \\\\ 5\\cdot 4+8\\cdot (-2)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-34 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & 3 \\\\ 5 & 8\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-34 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$"}]
